and `verifyTotpCode` always pass. `post(path, body)` answers the status code. `mfaWrites()` answers every `UPDATE users SET`
statement that writes `mfa_enabled`, as `[column names, params]`. No database, no Redis, no off-host socket.

**Reproduce the body below EXACTLY as written.** It is 141 lines. Do not shorten it, do not replace any part with a comment, do
